 "subs_note": "<b>Print/digital split is now ACTUAL</b> (Piano Subscription Report term export), replacing the earlier estimate &mdash; which it validated almost exactly (est. 32,295 / 14,309). Of ~46.7K active subs, <b>69% (32,224) are print</b> and <b>31% (14,461) are digital</b> (~14,058 paid). <b>The problem to solve:</b> new subscriptions roughly halved YoY (504 vs 1,058 in July), collapsing net adds &mdash; acquisition, not retention, is the gap (print churn is only 0.25%/mo). Note the dedicated <b>Sports Pass (674)</b>, consistent with sports being the strongest per-view converter.",
